30 times. That's how often one guy in Denver boxed in a Waymo with cones and egged it. Detailing ran about $2,000 and the DA passed on charges.

Robotaxis are coming anyway. {my take as an FSD owner}

Would you ride in one? 🚕

4.4 megawatts of solar over a cranberry bog in Massachusetts. They harvested the berries right under the panels.

Palisade peaches next? {my take on Western Slope farms and solar}

Would you put panels over a crop? ☀️
